<h2>Segment 255 &mdash; the concession and refuge verse</h2>
<div class="pair">
<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s255S"><span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s255p1">chos thams cad</span> la <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s255p2">&#x27;di yin &#x27;di min gang du yang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w3">bzung</span> du <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w4">med</span> pa&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p5">phyir</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w6">&#x27;dod</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p7">na</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w8">yod</span> par <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w9">thal</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w10">bdag</span> ni <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w11">ston pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w12">gzhan</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w13">spangs</span> nas, , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w14">khyod</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p15">la</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w16">skyabs su <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s255m17">mchi</span></span> lags kyi, , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w18">ci slad</span> ce na <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w19">khyed</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p20">nyid</span> ni, , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w21">skyon</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p22">mi</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w23">mnga&#x27;</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p24">zhing</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w25">yon tan</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w26">rdzogs</span>, , zhes <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w27">gsungs</span> pa&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p28">phyir</span></span>
</div>
<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s255S">And you must be suggesting all this, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p5">for</span> you have claimed that we should <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w4">never</span> again <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w3">consider</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s255p1">anything</span> as being <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s255p2">one way or the other</span>. Now <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p7">if</span> you should <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w6">agree</span> that none of the differences mentioned above exist, we <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w9">must reply that</span> they <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w8">do</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p28">for</span> as the verse <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w27">says</span>: All <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w12">other</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w11">teachers</span> now <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w10">I</span>&#x27;ve <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w13">given up</span>, And <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w16"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s255m17">go</span> for refuge</span> now <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p15">to</span> only <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w14">You</span>; <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w18">Why</span>? Because it&#x27;s <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w19">You</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p20">alone</span> who <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w23">has</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p22">No</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w21">fault</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s255p24">and</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w26">perfected</span> every <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s255w25">good</span>.</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, English-first. The opening restates the opponent's premise; 'dod na is the following concession ('agree', 'if'), not the earlier supplied 'have claimed'. yod owns 'do' as the complete existential predicate under English ellipsis, and thal owns 'must reply that'. bdag licenses only 'I' in 'I've'; the auxiliary remains unwrapped. ston pa owns 'teachers', gzhan only 'other', and spangs 'given up'; 'All' and 'now' are supplied. skyabs su mchi is the attested compound 'go for refuge', with its unique tighter mchi → go member. The first You belongs to khyod and the second to khyed; nyid licenses 'alone'. mnga' owns 'has', mi owns 'No', skyon owns 'fault'; yon tan owns 'good' and rdzogs 'perfected', leaving 'every' unwrapped. Both phyir occurrences own their respective causal 'for'; the for inside 'go for refuge' is not taken. zhing owns the final lower-case 'and' before 'perfected'. Omitted ni, nas, lags kyi, ce na and zhes are not treated as unresolved nulls; their topic, sequencing, politeness and quotation functions remain in the original source. Supplied debate exposition and 'the verse' stay unwrapped.</div>
